    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel '13C-bicarbonate and 15N-urea tracer addition, on-deck incubation at simulated in-situ light level, filtration'@en ;
    skos:definition 'Bicarbonate labelled with carbon-13 and urea labelled with nitrogen-15 were both added to the sample which was held for a predetermined time in a surface seawater bath and quantitatively shaded natural light (level usually designed to mimic collection depth and documented elsewhere) before filtration to collect the particulate phase.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:S03::S03493'^^xsd:string .
