    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel '14C-LEU-tracer addition, incubation in the dark, acidification, purging and trapping CO2'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The sample was spiked with radioactive leucine (an amino acid), retained for a predetermined time under controlled conditions in the dark before dissolved gases were stripped and their CO2 component retained for analysis.'@en ;
